{"id":"t02-eb0799","status":"read","groups":[{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو بكر بن أبي شيبة","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"غندر","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"شعبة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"محمد بن المثنى","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"ابن بشار","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"محمد بن جعفر","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"شعبة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}],[{"surface":"عمرو بن مرة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}],[{"surface":"ابن أبي ليلى","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"قيس بن سعد","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"سهل بن حنيف","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"القاسم بن زكرياء","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"عبيد الله بن موسى","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"شيبان","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"الأعمش","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"عمرو بن مرة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}],[{"surface":"بهذا الإسناد","kind":"back_reference"}]]}],"shared_tail":null,"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["«ح» splits the first route from the second; the first route ends at Shu'ba.","Third route (وحدثنيه) names no Companion itself: «بهذا الإسناد» closes it on the names of the second route, not written again.","«- وفيه -» and the Companions' «فقالا» in the third route are the same report's wording; «قيس بن سعد» and «سهل بن حنيف» speak the saying together («فقالا»), so they are the last link of the second route."],"fixes":[]}
